{"ts": 0.058706, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 2 · Paths and the filesystem\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m2.1\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 243}
{"ts": 0.06072, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m2.1 — ls: what's in here\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mls\u001b[0m lists files and folders in your current directory.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m            \u001b[90m# names only\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls -l\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# long form (permissions, size, date)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls -a\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# include hidden files (those starting with .)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nTry each. Then \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m a folder you don't \u001b[92mcd\u001b[0m into:\r\n  \u001b[92mls /etc\u001b[0m       \u001b[90m# system config folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls /usr/bin\u001b[0m   \u001b[90m# where many commands live\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n(\u001b[90m/etc\u001b[0m and \u001b[90m/usr/bin\u001b[0m exist on both Linux and macOS.)\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try a few, then \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 617}
